{"ticker":"FITB","updated":"2026-11-06T23:57:10Z","profile":{"longName":"Fifth Third Bancorp","shortName":"Fifth Third Bancorp","sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Banks - Regional","country":"United States","website":"https://www.53.com","fullTimeEmployees":25069,"marketCap":47929372672,"trailingPE":17.798658,"forwardPE":10.681081,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":4.2959013,"pegRatio":1.7,"targetMeanPrice":61.53571,"targetHighPrice":67.0,"targetLowPrice":55.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":21,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.505,"earningsGrowth":-0.011,"grossMargins":0.0,"operatingMargins":0.4209,"profitMargins":0.22972,"totalRevenue":11157000192,"beta":0.989,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":59.5,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":40.68,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":3.14},"summary":"Fifth Third Bancorp operates as the bank holding company for Fifth Third Bank, National Association that provides a range of financial products and services in the United States. It operates through three segments: Commercial Banking, Consumer and Small Business Banking, and Wealth and Asset Management. The Commercial Banking segment offers credit intermediation, cash management, and financial services; lending and depository products; and cash management, foreign exchange and international trade finance, derivatives and capital markets services, asset-based lending, real estate finance, public finance, commercial leasing, and syndicated finance for business, government, and professional customers. Its Consumer and Small Banking segment engages in the provision of a range of deposit and loan products to individuals and small businesses; residential mortgage activities, including the origination, retention and servicing of residential mortgage loans, sales and securitizations of loans, and associated hedging activities; home equity loans and lines of credit, credit cards, automobile and other indirect lending, and other consumer lending services; and home improvement and solar energy installation loans through contractors and installers. The Wealth and Asset Management segment provides various wealth management services, such as wealth planning, investment management, banking, i","summary_zh":"Fifth Third Bancorp 是 Fifth Third Bank 的銀行控股公司，該銀行是全國協會，在美國提供一系列金融產品和服務。它透過三個部門運作：商業銀行業務、消費者和小型企業銀行業務以及財富和資產管理業務。商業銀行部門提供信貸中介、現金管理和金融服務；貸款和存款產品；現金管理、外匯和國際貿易融資、衍生性商品和資本市場服務、資產借貸、房地產金融、公共金融、商業租賃以及為企業、政府和專業客戶提供的銀團融資。其消費者和小型銀行部門向個人和小型企業提供一系列存款和貸款產品；住宅抵押貸款活動，包括住宅抵押貸款的發放、保留和服務、貸款的銷售和證券化以及相關的對沖活動；房屋淨值貸款和信用額度、信用卡、汽車和其他間接貸款以及其他消費貸款服務；透過承包商和安裝商提供家居裝修和太陽能安裝貸款。財富與資產管理分部提供各種財富管理服務，例如財富規劃、投資管理、銀行、","sector_zh":"金融服務","industry_zh":"銀行 - 區域","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-08","o":45.7,"h":45.7,"l":44.76,"c":45.49,"v":5323600},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":45.42,"h":45.88,"l":45.23,"c":45.42,"v":4716900},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":45.2,"h":46.5,"l":45.2,"c":45.51,"v":7515900},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":45.51,"h":45.65,"l":45.04,"c":45.27,"v":4398000},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":45.26,"h":45.7,"l":45.14,"c":45.56,"v":3469700},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":45.67,"h":45.79,"l":45.28,"c":45.36,"v":4120600},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":45.46,"h":45.46,"l":44.5,"c":45.0,"v":4613700},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":45.09,"h":46.29,"l":45.09,"c":45.91,"v":4946000},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":46.11,"h":46.48,"l":45.71,"c":46.28,"v":3655700},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":46.46,"h":46.49,"l":45.89,"c":46.08,"v":8455700},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":45.68,"h":45.86,"l":44.77,"c":44.95,"v":5458300},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":45.02,"h":45.68,"l":44.91,"c":45.14,"v":3859400},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":45.08,"h":45.52,"l":44.81,"c":45.17,"v":3479800},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":45.16,"h":45.4,"l":44.89,"c":45.28,"v":3981900},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":45.57,"h":45.98,"l":45.32,"c":45.43,"v":2601700},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":45.57,"h":45.57,"l":44.99,"c":45.4,"v":3340900},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":44.93,"h":45.17,"l":43.76,"c":44.55,"v":4648800},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":44.37,"h":44.75,"l":44.19,"c":44.35,"v":3763500},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":44.29,"h":44.48,"l":43.88,"c":44.22,"v