dOcUo4MzdmNEFzaG9PUURCVVVUTC1STjVScFVyczVZaWVnT1V1VEV4cW5PRFQxYmJjNFdhMnhlLV9VVXVaUlkzRnBpM1hnYk5xeHlmNkgxdXl2U0ZQOE5kWEhiTXZCY1RuSlhYZFRvT0hPRGs?oc=5","date":"2026-10-20","zh":"Fifth Third Bancorp (FITB) 在進行最大的轉換後發布了強勁的 2026 年第三季收益"},{"title":"Fifth Third Bancorp (NYSE:FITB) Stock Price","src":"Simply Wall St","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiTkFVX3lxTE5fQVprUTBiT1REN1E0NnQ4MVVkdnhMQ0hzWEpyYWlRSy1QQm5jSXd4SEx2M1gxZ1VuNXRWekZ3VExhMWkwVEpEbVh6UXliUQ?oc=5","date":"2026-10-20","zh":"Fifth Third Bancorp (NYSE：FITB) 股票價格"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":4},{"name":"分析師評等","count":3},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":2},{"name":"併購","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-24","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/35527/000003552726000124/fitb-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Fifth Third Bancorp (the \"Bancorp\" or \"Fifth Third\"), an Ohio corporation organized in 1975, is a bank holding company (\"BHC\") as defined by the Bank Holding Company Act of 1956, as amended (the \"BHCA\"), and has elected to be treated as a financial holding company (\"FHC\") under the Gramm-Leach-Bliley Act of 1999 (\"GLBA\") and regulations of the Board of Governors of the Federal Reserve System (the \"FRB\").","zh":"Fifth Third Bancorp（「Bancorp」或「Fifth Third」）是一家成立於 1975 年的俄亥俄州公司，根據 1956 年《銀行控股公司法》及其修訂案（「BHCA」）的定義，是一家銀行控股公司（「BHC」），並根據 1999 年《Gramm-Leach-Bliley法案》（“GLBA”）和理事會的規定選擇被視為金融控股公司（“FHC”）聯邦儲備系統（“FRB”）。"},{"en":"The Bancorp is a diversified financial services company headquartered in Cincinnati, Ohio and is the indirect holding company of Fifth Third Bank, National Association (the \"Bank\"). As of December 31, 2025, Fifth Third had $214 billion in assets and operates 1,130 full-service Banking Centers and 2,199 Fifth Third branded ATMs in Ohio, Kentucky, Indiana, Michigan, Illinois, Florida, Tennessee, West Virginia, Georgia, North Carolina, South Carolina and Alabama. The Bancorp operates three main businesses: Commercial Banking, Consumer and Small Business Banking and Wealth and Asset Management. The Bancorp's trust and registered investment advisory businesses had approximately $690 billion in total assets under care and managed $80 billion in assets for individuals, corporations and not-for-profit organizations as of December 31, 2025. Fifth Third's common stock is traded on the NASDAQ Globa","zh":"Bancorp 是一家多元化金融服務公司，總部位於俄亥俄州辛辛那提，是全國協會第五第三銀行（「銀行」）的間接控股公司。截至 2025 年 12 月 31 日，Fifth Third 擁有 2,140 億美元資產，並在俄亥俄州、肯塔基州、印第安納州、密西根州、伊利諾伊州、佛羅裡達州、田納西州、西維吉尼亞州、喬治亞州、北卡羅來納州、南卡羅來納州和阿拉巴馬州經營 1,130 個全方位服務銀行中心和 20988 20078 20072 20072 20072 2222/2/2222///////////////////////////////////////////////////197 月 202 台品牌服務。该银行经营三项主要业务：商业银行业务、消费者和小型企业银行业务以及财富和资产管理业务。截至 2025 年 12 月 31 日，Bancorp 的信託和註冊投資顧問業務管理的總資產約為 6,900 億美元，為個人、企業和非營利組織管理著 800 億美元的資產。 Fifth Third 的普通股在纳斯达克全球交易所交易"},{"en":"The Bancorp's subsidiaries provide a wide range of financial products and services to the commercial, financial, retail, governmental, educational, energy and healthcare sectors. This includes a variety of checking, savings and money market accounts, wealth management solutions, payments and commerce solutions, securities products and services, insurance services and credit products such as commercial loans and leases, mortgage loans, credit cards, installment loans and other lending products. These products and services are delivered through a variety of channels including the Bancorp's banking centers, other offices, telephone sales, the internet and mobile applications. The Bank has deposit insurance provided by the Federal Deposit Insurance Corporation (the \"FDIC\") through the Deposit Insurance Fund (the \"DIF\"). Refer to Exhibit 21 filed as an attachment to this Annual Report on Form","zh":"Bancorp 的子公司为商业、金融、零售、政府、教育、能源和医疗保健行业提供广泛的金融产品和服务。這包括各種支票、儲蓄和貨幣市場帳戶、財富管理解決方案、支付和商業解決方案、證券產品和服務、保險服務以及商業貸款和租賃、抵押貸款、信用卡、分期貸款和其他貸款產品等信貸產品。這些產品和服務透過多種管道提供，包括 Bancorp 的銀行中心、其他辦事處、電話銷售、網路和行動應用程式。本行拥有联邦存款保险公司（“FDIC”）通过存款保险基金（“DIF”）提供的存款保险。请参阅作为本年度报告表格附件提交的附件 21"}],"markets":[],"customers":[],"competition":[{"en":"The Bancorp, primarily through the Bank, competes for deposits, loans and other banking services in its principal geographic markets as well as in selected national markets as opportunities arise. In addition to banking institutions, the Bancorp competes with securities dealers, brokers, mortgage bankers, investment advisors, specialty finance, private credit, financial technology and insurance companies. These companies compete across geographic boundaries and provide customers with meaningful alternatives to traditional banking services in nearly all significant products. The increasingly competitive environment is primarily a result of changes in regulation, changes in technology, product delivery systems and the accelerating pace of consolidation among financial service providers. These competitive trends are likely to continue.","zh":"該銀行主要透過該銀行在其主要地理市場以及機會出現時在選定的國家市場上競爭存款、貸款和其他銀行服務。除銀行機構外，該銀行還與證券交易商、經紀人、抵押貸款銀行家、投資顧問、專業金融、私人信貸、金融科技和保險公司競爭。這些公司跨越地理界限進行競爭，並在幾乎所有重要產品中為客戶提供傳統銀行服務的有意義的替代方案。競爭日益激烈的環境主要是監管變化、技術變化、產品交付系統以及金融服務提供者之間整合步伐加快的結果。這些競爭趨勢可能會持續下去。"},{"en":"The Bancorp's human capital strategy is designed to attract, develop and retain talent. This strategy ensures that Fifth Third has the talent, capabilities and organizational structure to support business needs now and in the future. As of December 31, 2025, the Bancorp had 18,676 full-time equivalent employees, compared to 18,616 as of December 31, 2024. These employees support the organization's ambition and purpose by upholding its values by committing to excellence, being connected and acting with creativity and courage. Fifth Third is committed to living its values, serving its customers, delivering financial performance and being recognized as a leader in building an engaging workplace.","zh":""}],"segments":{},"peers":["HBAN","KEY","RF","PNC","ZION"]}}